WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:06,150
Three people handle the sheep, put the legs alone, cut the lean meat into strips, and make sure the skin is not slippery.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:07,750
What about Xu Luoer and the others?

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:08,750
They have other jobs

4
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:14,240
Also prepare fruits for us

5
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:15,840
What good things are you thinking about?

6
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,240
Fruits are materials for your work

7
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:20,240
This is not afternoon tea for the eldest lady.

8
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:23,240
These grapes are going to be crushed and I'm going to try making wine

9
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,240
What to press with

10
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:27,640
Originally, the easiest way was to just wash your feet, right?

11
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:28,640
Just wait a moment

12
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,840
What did you just say?

13
00:00:29,840 --> 00:00:32,240
Trampling grapes, traditional practice, problematic

14
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,640
You ask us to take off our shoes

15
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,440
Do you have any other hobbies?

16
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:39,440
What do you have in mind all day long?

17
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:41,420
It’s okay if you don’t want to step on it

18
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,220
Grapes still need to be treated

19
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:44,820
Do not pinch directly with your hands

20
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:45,820
Find a way yourself

21
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:46,820
Who can't finish it?

22
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,820
Just go down and kowtow the sheep
